      "stem": "다음 지문에서 밑줄 친 낱말 중 문맥상 쓰임이 적절하지 않은 것을 고르시오.\n\nKim Mandeok was born in Jeju-do in 1739. She was a ①successful businesswoman. In 1795, she saw many people ②dying from hunger. So, she bought rice with all her money and gave it away to ③poor people. Her love for others was so ④selfish that many people respected her. From her life, I learned that selfless love for others can make a big ⑤difference.",
